<title>ITALY: Lira to re-enter ERM at 990 lire vs mark - ANSA.</title>
<headline>Lira to re-enter ERM at 990 lire vs mark - ANSA.</headline>
<dateline>ROME 1996-11-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Portuguese sources said on Sunday that European Union Finance Ministers had agreed that the lira would be allowed to re-enter the Exchange Rate Mechanism at a central rate of 990 lire per mark, Italian agency ANSA reported.</p>
<p>Reporting from Brussels, the Italian news agency quoted the sourees as saying that EU Finance Ministers and central bank governors were working on the text of a final statement.</p>
</text>
